<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?> <?xml-stylesheet type="text/xsl" href="rss.xsl"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"> <channel> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title><description>SONiC NOS（sonic-net/SONiC）の日本語非公式ドキュメント</description><link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link><atom:link href="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /> <docs>https://github.com/aoki-taquan/sonic-unofficial-docs</docs><language>ja</language> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 04:56:42 -0000</pubDate> <lastBuildDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 04:56:42 -0000</lastBuildDate> <ttl>1440</ttl> <generator>MkDocs RSS plugin - v1.19.0</generator> <image> <url>None</url> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link> </image> <item> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title> <description>SONiC NOS (community master) を AI が日本語で再構成した非公式ドキュメント。学ぶ / 設定する / 修理する の 3 つの入り口から、894 ページの全文検索可能なリファレンスへ。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 04:45:20 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/index.png" type="image/png" length="29457" /> </item> <item> <title>ページが見つかりません (404)</title> <description>404 - ページが見つかりません — ページ上部の検索ボックスで日本語キーワード（例: BGP, VXLAN, dual-tor, dhcprelayd）を入力すると、横断検索ができます。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/404/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/404/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/404.png" type="image/png" length="26132" /> </item> <item> <title>初めての方の必読 10 (Essentials)</title> <description>初めての方の必読 10 (Essentials) — SONiC をこれから学ぶ読者が「全体像を最短で掴む」ために最初に読むべき 10 ページを順序立てて紹介する curation ページ。HLD 単位ではなく学習導線として並べ直し、ネットワークエンジニア / ソフトウェアエンジニア / 運用エンジニアの読み手別おすすめも併記する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/getting-started/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/getting-started/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/getting-started.png" type="image/png" length="33144" /> </item> <item> <title>変更履歴</title> <category>changelog</category> <category>meta</category> <description>変更履歴 — このページは merged PR のメタデータから meta/scripts/gen_changelog.py で機械生成されています。手で編集しないでください。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/changelog.png" type="image/png" length="19713" /> </item> <item> <title>スナップショット</title> <description>&lt;h1&gt;スナップショット&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;リポジトリ全体の状態を 1 ページに集約した自動生成サマリ。個別の詳細は &lt;code&gt;coverage.md&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;sitemap.md&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;discrepancies.md&lt;/code&gt; を参照。&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;!!! note &#34;生成元&#34; `python3 meta/scripts/gen_snapsho...&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/snapshot/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/snapshot/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/snapshot.png" type="image/png" length="16430" /> </item> <item> <title>ACL &amp; QoS</title> <description>ACL &amp; QoS — ACL、CoPP、mirror、buffer、PFC、watermark、scheduler などパケット制御と QoS を扱う章。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/index.png" type="image/png" length="32472" /> </item> <item> <title>アーキテクチャ</title> <description>アーキテクチャ — SONiC 全体構成、ビルド、管理基盤、共通設計を横断的に扱う章。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/index.png" type="image/png" length="13896" /> </item> <item> <title>ポート不正パケットドロップ設計（Interface MIB / L3 カウンタ拡張）</title> <description>ポート不正パケットドロップ設計（Interface MIB / L3 カウンタ拡張） — SNMP の Interface MIB（RFC1213）が返すインタフェースカウンタは、もともと L2 ポート単位のカウンタのみを対象としていた。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/port-illegal-packets-drop-design/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/port-illegal-packets-drop-design/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/port-illegal-packets-drop-design.png" type="image/png" length="32512" /> </item> <item> <title>内部実装</title> <description>内部実装 — Redis、SwSS、orchagent、counter、P4Orch など実装内部の構造を扱う章。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/internals/index.png" type="image/png" length="18463" /> </item> <item> <title>ZMQ ProducerStateTable / ConsumerStateTable 設計</title> <description>ZMQ ProducerStateTable / ConsumerStateTable 設計 — 通常の ProducerStateTable / ConsumerStateTable は Redis 経由でメッセージを運ぶ。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/zmq-producer-consumer-state-table-design/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/zmq-producer-consumer-state-table-design/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/internals/zmq-producer-consumer-state-table-design.png" type="image/png" length="42995" /> </item> <item> <title>マネジメント</title> <description>マネジメント — CLI 以外の設定・管理経路、gNMI / REST / YANG / AAA / P4RT など管理プレーンを扱う章。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/index.png" type="image/png" length="17550" /> </item> <item> <title>AAA Improvements（PAM / NSS / D-Bus / RBAC 多重ロール）</title> <description>AAA Improvements（PAM / NSS / D-Bus / RBAC 多重ロール） — SONiC の AAA（Authentication / Authorization / Accounting）を Linux PAM / NSS / D-Bus 層から見直し、以下の既知の問題を解く設計提案:</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/aaa-improvements/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/aaa-improvements/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/aaa-improvements.png" type="image/png" length="51882" /> </item> <item> <title>Redis Client Manager（RCM: connection pool / transactional client）</title> <description>Redis Client Manager（RCM: connection pool / transactional client） — sonic-mgmt-common の translib（gNMI GET/SET/SUBSCRIBE 処理）は内部で 大量の Redis client を作成し、Redis TCP…</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/redis-client-manager-rcm-hld/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/redis-client-manager-rcm-hld/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/redis-client-manager-rcm-hld.png" type="image/png" length="55405" /> </item> <item> <title>SONiC Application Extension 開発・移植ガイド</title> <description>SONiC Application Extension 開発・移植ガイド — SONiC の docker 化された機能（DHCP relay 等）を Application Extension 形式に移植する手順、新規 extension の開発フロー、3rd party app をパッケージデータベースに登録する…</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/sonic-application-extension-guide/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/sonic-application-extension-guide/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/sonic-application-extension-guide.png" type="image/png" length="49526" /> </item> <item> <title>SONiC NOS の設定手段一覧（CLI / sonic-cfggen / config_db.json / RESTCONF / gNMI / ZTP / vtysh / redis / apply-patch）</title> <description>SONiC NOS の設定手段一覧 — SONiC は CONFIG_DB（Redis db 4）に 複数の入口 を提供し、最終的に /etc/sonic/config_db.json で永続化する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/sonic-nos-configuration-methods/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/sonic-nos-configuration-methods/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/sonic-nos-configuration-methods.png" type="image/png" length="45341" /> </item> <item> <title>オーバーレイ</title> <description>オーバーレイ — VXLAN / VNet、DASH、Dual ToR、NVGRE など overlay と SmartSwitch 周辺を扱う章。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/overlay/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/overlay/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/overlay/index.png" type="image/png" length="22502" /> </item> <item> <title>プラットフォーム</title> <description>プラットフォーム — SAI、PMON、センサー、トランシーバ、プラットフォーム API、シャーシ機能を扱う章。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/platform/index.png" type="image/png" length="14988" /> </item> <item> <title>VoQ Chassis での Everflow ミラー（recycle port 経由の rewrite）</title> <description>VoQ Chassis での Everflow ミラー（recycle port 経由の rewrite） — Everflow は SONiC のミラーリング機能（ERSPAN）で、destination IP を持つ ミラーセッションを作るとパケットが GRE encap されて送られる。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/everflow-support-on-voq-chassis/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/everflow-support-on-voq-chassis/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/platform/everflow-support-on-voq-chassis.png" type="image/png" length="59868" /> </item> <item> <title>config muxcable サブコマンド</title> <description>config muxcable サブコマンド — config muxcable は Dual-ToR 構成で使用する Y-Cable (NIC ↔ ToR-A / ToR-B) の状態と低レイヤ機能 (PRBS, loopback, FW, FEC,